      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Purple (#8a3ffc): IBM Verify Identity Access  |  Cyan (#0072c3): HashiCorp Vault  |  Blue (#0f62fe): EKS / Agent pods\nTeal (#007d79): Amazon RDS PostgreSQL  |  Green (#198038): Amazon Bedrock AI  |  Gray (#525252): AWS managed services\nThick purple arrow between Vault <-> IVIA = JWKS validation — THE SEAM (identity propagation boundary)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Purple (#8a3ffc): IBM Verify Identity Access  |  Cyan (#0072c3): HashiCorp Vault  |  Blue (#0f62fe): EKS / Agent pods\nTeal (#007d79): Amazon RDS PostgreSQL  |  Green (#198038): Amazon Bedrock AI  |  Gray (#525252): AWS managed services\nThick purple arrow between Vault <-> IVIA = JWKS validation — THE SEAM (identity propagation boundary)",
